"<p>If it's parental leave, you can do your shopping at <span t-esc=\"(object.partner_id.company_id.name or '')\"/>.</p>\n"
"<p>10 days before the estimated end of leave date you have given us, you will receive a message reminding you to contact the Members' Office to join a team again.</p><br/>\n"
"<p>Have a nice day,</p>\n"
"<p>Members office <span t-esc=\"(object.partner_id.company_id.phone or '')\"/></p>\n"
"<p>For any questions or requests, please call or drop by the Membership Office during regular business hours.</p>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<pre><span t-esc=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/></pre>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<p>Bonjour <span t-esc=\"object.partner_id.name\"/></p>\n"
