msgid ""
"<p>Hello <span t-esc=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>,</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"You requested disability leave from the Membership Office.\n"
"In order for this leave to be validated, you had 3 weeks to present us with medical proof.\n"
"Unless we are mistaken, we have not seen this document.\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>Your leave was therefore unsuccessful.</p>\n"
"<p>Services missed during your absence are now recorded as missed services.</p>\n"
"<p>To regularize your situation, contact the members' office during its opening hours:</p>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<pre><span t-esc=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/></pre>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<p><span t-esc=\"(object.partner_id.company_id.phone or '')\"/></p>\n"
"<span>Have a nice day,</span>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<span>The Membership Office</span>\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<span><span t-esc=\"(object.partner_id.company_id.name or '')\"/></span>\n"
"\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<p>Bonjour <span t-esc=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>,</p>\n"
"<div>\n"
"Vous aviez demandé un congé pour incapacité auprès du Bureau des membres.\n"
"Pour que ce congé soit validé, vous aviez 3 semaines pour nous présenter un justificatif médical.\n"
"Sauf erreur de notre part, nous n’avons pas reçu ce document.\n"
"</div>\n"
"<p>Votre congé n’a donc pas pu être validé.</p>\n"
"<p>Les services manqués pendant votre absence sont désormais enregistrés comme des services manqués.</p>\n"
"<p>Pour régulariser votre situation, contactez le Bureau des membres pendant ses horaires d’ouverture :</p>\n"
"<br/>\n"
