"<p>You have a service that falls on <span t-esc=\"object.convert_format_datatime()\"/>.</p>\n"
"<p>During your service, the store will be open. As this is a public holiday or other special day for <span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/>, if you cannot provide your service, you will be allocated only one catch instead of two .</p>\n"
"<p>However, so that the supermarket can function normally, we remind you that the ideal solution remains the exchange of service with another cooperator.</p>\n"
"<p>Sincerely,</p>\n"
"<p>Membership office\n"
"<br/>\n"
"<span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.phone or '')\"/></p>\n"
"<p>The members' office does not take any requests by email. For any questions or requests, please call or drop by the Membership Office during regular business hours.</p>\n"
