"  margin-left: 0;\n"
"  padding-left: 0;\n"
"}\n"
"#notify-mirror-children &amp;gt; ol &amp;gt; li {\n"
"  display: block;\n"
"  margin-bottom: .5em;\n"
"  margin-left: 2em;\n"
"}\n"
"#notify-mirror-children &amp;gt; ol &amp;gt; li::before {\n"
"  display: inline-block;\n"
"  content: counter(item) \") \";\n"
"  counter-increment: item;\n"
"  width: 2em;\n"
"  margin-left: -2em;\n"
"}\n"
"</style>\n"
"<body><div id=\"notify-mirror-children\">\n"
"<p>Hello,</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Your related child will soon be 18 years old. We wish him a happy birthday in advance.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"On his birthday, he / she will be unlinked from your account and will lose buyer rights to <span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/>.\n"
"If he / she wishes to continue shopping at <span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/>, there are 2 possibilities:\n"
"</p>\n"
"<ol>\n"
"<li>He / she becomes a member of <span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/>.\n"
"You must visit our website and register for a welcome meeting, then follow the steps you have taken to become a member of <span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/>.\n"
"</li>\n"
"<li>He / she becomes attached to an adult... a possibility only if you do not already have another adult in your household associated with your account at <span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/>.\n"
"For him / her to become a connected adult, you must both go to the Members' office during opening hours.\n"
"Your child must bring a piece of identification and proof that he / she lives at the same address as you.\n"
"</li>\n"
"</ol>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Have a good day,\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p><span t-esc=\"(object.company_id.name or '')\"/></p>\n"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"        </body>"
